# Deno ignore file - excludes files from Deno language server analysis

# Node.js projects
**/node_modules/
**/package-lock.json
**/yarn.lock

# Next.js build outputs
**/.next/
**/out/
**/build/

# Backend directory (Node.js project)
../backend/

# Documentation
../docs/

# Flutter/Dart build outputs  
**/build/
**/.dart_tool/

# iOS
**/ios/Pods/
**/ios/.symlinks/
**/ios/Flutter/Flutter.framework/
**/ios/Flutter/Flutter.podspec

# Android
**/android/.gradle/
**/android/captures/
**/android/gradlew
**/android/gradlew.bat
**/android/local.properties
**/android/key.properties

# IDE files
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/*.iml

# OS files
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Logs
**/logs/
**/*.log

# Environment files
**/.env*

# Lock files
**/deno.lock